• [color=orange]Session Sharing[/color] - Anonymized package creation and export
• [color=purple]Analytics Features[/color] - Comprehensive productivity metrics and insights
• [color=cyan]Export Formats[/color] - Format validation and feature testing
• [color=red]Error Handling[/color] - Edge cases and graceful failure testing

[b]Keyboard Shortcuts:[/b]
• F10 - Run all Phase 4.6 tests
• F11 - Test report generation only  
• F12 - Test analytics features only

[b]Test Status:[/b] Ready to run comprehensive Phase 4.6 feature validation."

